# --- Secrets & configuration with credentials (never commit) ---
# The repository ships appsettings.Development.example.json and
# appsettings.Production.example.json (placeholders only). Every real
# configuration file stays local and is ignored here:
#   copy src/HamzetWasl.Api/appsettings.Development.example.json
#        src/HamzetWasl.Api/appsettings.Development.json
# Real secrets come from environment variables, user secrets or a secret store.
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.env
.env
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.snk

